#: scenario3:scenario3_C9E97BEC_821B_49B4_AD75_726CCF04AEA2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: eb1d749c817f0ba416b9478b76aa66430823d8f710840f8be5f6abae099f2055
#. default-sha256: b765d2f9c32ca80cb3bc0cdbadf7013c7a9f23704ae0c86bd8b5f8c708d091c7
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C9E97BEC_821B_49B4_AD75_726CCF04AEA2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫Ah, they have grown to be so "
"beautiful..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫Ah, elas cresceram e ficaram tão "
"lindas..."

#: scenario3:scenario3_5D915F34_3442_4BDA_9B75_EA6963124549
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a23a550cca1818dffaed4f0e82928a4dda6d89b00332f6d22517a37b8bd3b7c5
#. default-sha256: 1f009360f49ae653168076134a6928c61ba53049483d470961910a1b41d61d2a
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_5D915F34_3442_4BDA_9B75_EA6963124549"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Such a wonderful fragrance.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫The scent of roses is so calming.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I wonder why "
"that is..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Que fragrância maravilhosa.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫O cheiro de rosas é tão calmante.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Eu me "
"pergunto por que..."

#: scenario3:scenario3_D68FB132_36D1_43CB_8AC1_FBDE0EF33E34
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d258898e64c55926f16ffe51b1e2ca31be7c9ec78ef199f85e49e99e9cfa7da0
#. default-sha256: bf3e74f6680b645fa726f296c83bd55da3ca3f6799173befe333c1b19a827239
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D68FB132_36D1_43CB_8AC1_FBDE0EF33E34"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫...Would it cause any trouble if I picked one?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫...Causaria algum problema se eu pegasse uma?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_5B7634D2_4B4F_4508_8561_EF1B27F9F49C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 41585a739ef327979331508167ecc9f43da5ef6112b2c5be6a1f212d2b8d8111
#. default-sha256: a4c2da2752cf4545e7ce5ece4fb0d07b240a881c5b24c3b734af43275c00b711
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_5B7634D2_4B4F_4508_8561_EF1B27F9F49C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Well, hello there. Out for a midnight stroll, are you?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Quite the peculiar "
"hobby... ⟪k:4⟫“Madam”?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Bem, olá. Saiu para um passeio à meia-noite, não é?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Um passatempo bastante "
"peculiar... ⟪k:4⟫“Madame”?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_5A3AB145_58BD_41A4_8A2F_2FB5A8C21D76
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4f043cc146ef06298430325342ae7ace9013be22f74dc0dcb8f4cda531b2000c
#. default-sha256: da2c4b6c83e2d5c41a03bb2787de5a567c7268e2241767973d85e2c9be3137ea
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_5A3AB145_58BD_41A4_8A2F_2FB5A8C21D76"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫U-⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Um, ⟪k:5⟫I cannot spend as much time as I would like outside during "
"the day, so I end up coming out at night...⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫I apologize if I startled you."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫H-⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Hum, ⟪k:5⟫Não posso passar tanto tempo quanto gostaria ao ar livre "
"durante o dia, então acabo saindo à noite...⟪k:6⟫ Peço desculpas se te assustei."

#: scenario3:scenario3_F04C7A2F_4D50_486F_B1A4_9A351110B7F0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 473b594d204f92eabe5760894c3a4aef1d90542043159481b1a88c1ca590f89d
#. default-sha256: 78b64ba360638da1a8f0b457aa9d2dbcd3c865a8131626264ab343911e2c67d0
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F04C7A2F_4D50_486F_B1A4_9A351110B7F0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Oh no, not at all."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Ah, não, de jeito nenhum."

#: scenario3:scenario3_89149FFE_056C_40EC_AA10_89D8B6933C25
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 25904d91dbb5a061e9f821088a45c1d5fc3acb6cdb285ff8bcd1d5e30afcb8e4
#. default-sha256: f5cbb92ce283b42dd2f22baaf092c1fd5aa99b6d6aa05b2572b5836ccbced8f3
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_89149FFE_056C_40EC_AA10_89D8B6933C25"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫There is a chilling, captivating beauty to the sight of your snow-white form standing "
"there in the moonlit garden."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Há uma beleza inquietante e cativante na visão de sua forma branca como a neve parada "
"ali no jardim iluminado pela lua."

#: scenario3:scenario3_457BC5E0_624E_43E9_B1BB_AF87D2552128
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d4000c4a47620842d09b15e53692687e0b886ac164a13224bdc837d55d8e80aa
#. default-sha256: efe332474e55ce732859dea15f1331928c3b27dd3c238a3923b6f06385bb5e05
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_457BC5E0_624E_43E9_B1BB_AF87D2552128"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I would hardly...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Um, ⟪k:4⟫what are you doing out so late?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Eu não diria...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Hum, ⟪k:4⟫ o que você está fazendo tão tarde?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_654A59B7_5584_42CD_9134_31C48EE1A8E2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a8768dc418ba7c188ad8147165782b4328a99d2efb2d1a07fadc04f084a900e9
#. default-sha256: 1bac88f2e3a87c3396497ff85e5569637bb66ff215e6243908a84a84b52134e9
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_654A59B7_5584_42CD_9134_31C48EE1A8E2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I saw a figure through the window.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫On the slight chance it might be a burglar,"
"⟪k:4⟫I thought it my responsibility to ensure they did not break in."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Eu vi uma figura pela janela.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Na remota chance de ser um ladrão,⟪k:4⟫achei que "
"era minha responsabilidade garantir que ele não invadisse."

#: scenario3:scenario3_4935B276_EA74_4831_A52A_A645C452BEFF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6b5f5e8e8b7afb34783f27afd74d08ae0c5f1aa610dd6d0e6123aafd5f559abd
#. default-sha256: 811a9ddf88f02a85c8625f640033733b57d5dabe31d32694a2e7ae8cfa82efea
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_4935B276_EA74_4831_A52A_A645C452BEFF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫It was also the middle of the night when the grocer’s servant broke into their safe."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Era também no meio da noite, quando o criado do merceeiro arrombou o cofre deles."

#: scenario3:scenario3_34E7DCF2_024B_4C97_9867_2F839ECB2D7F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5f9e5596a0cfbed2337effe8e87c36d2f62bfbf1516902c0e9d440f4e1517fbd
#. default-sha256: 5a4562425ccce427f1bf2be1dcfc18c5b0cbab20fdecb8488e89045ab19a66cc
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_34E7DCF2_024B_4C97_9867_2F839ECB2D7F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫News of that spread quite far; I am sure you would have heard about it."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫As notícias disso se espalharam bastante; Tenho certeza que você teria ouvido falar sobre."

#: scenario3:scenario3_FCBA1534_5D4C_424D_BE7E_ED0CADCEA75C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b12949056998360bfce23d34f4a26bf665276af8f165fef2864d1c1ff3fd097e
#. default-sha256: 0c8d4f3fb4c5d13b67c3b9608dafea71ab8eb5175604f31eae6fabbe237ce266
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_FCBA1534_5D4C_424D_BE7E_ED0CADCEA75C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Oh, but Gemasch was imprisoned some time ago.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Dear me, cannot seem to get my "
"head out of the past."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Ah, mas já faz algum tempo que Gemasch foi preso.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Oh nossa, parece que não "
"consigo tirar minha cabeça do passado."

#: scenario3:scenario3_9F52C227_20CD_45C3_A885_8AEE78228065
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1f02956ca1619f083e3658a87fefb84e5c598af13ecac9288a92d240193e8cd5
#. default-sha256: a2ce88fad12ac924c7fca463f2ac707b04824bb78402cfe8f222c9c077cd2e11
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9F52C227_20CD_45C3_A885_8AEE78228065"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫U-⟪k:2⟫Um...?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫H-⟪k:2⟫Hum...?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_4A11ABC1_4B20_4CFC_994B_F02E1B694F3E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4cb4c3067f8f5b14293e89d940ebf8de6a044bbdd46f754710bb0dc99a90d22b
#. default-sha256: 00392f487fd9c19bde2b236bfe7db0d96781a8447a0460ad8087e570a7f158e5
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_4A11ABC1_4B20_4CFC_994B_F02E1B694F3E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Do you intend to give that white rose to someone?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Você pretende dar aquela rosa branca para alguém?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_E5C62BCD_F9BF_44B3_8771_5B061984E998
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1c3561ebc78dee5d7159a28940ee64d9e19134547d41c7e208e1fc676fddaeed
#. default-sha256: b4765c892130195b22de3d8202731d5e7b7d49c4bcf9e812d637925b0283dfea
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_E5C62BCD_F9BF_44B3_8771_5B061984E998"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫...Y-⟪k:2⟫Yes. ⟪k:3⟫I was thinking about giving it to my husband."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫...S-⟪k:2⟫Sim. ⟪k:3⟫Eu estava pensando em dar ao meu marido."

#: scenario3:scenario3_D451EF29_CB72_4698_80BB_220487F7C951
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 98539b2761b914d2d55e8cb149a4a30371713eb1ae89af55764d8079a7a8604e
#. default-sha256: 51f9f14f85d451dcf5671fcfad74340991bcedd27242e3516a1ec70893c98d4e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D451EF29_CB72_4698_80BB_220487F7C951"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫While I expect he has little fondness for such feminine tastes,⟪k:2⟫the scent of "
"flowers has a truly calming effect."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Embora eu espere que ele tenha pouca afeição por coisas tão femininas,⟪k:2⟫o perfume "
"das flores tem um efeito calmante."

#: scenario3:scenario3_80E6097D_BFF6_4A01_8208_FD02904C8D07
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fc21d5368df9ad15e1dad2da7f3c6824ffdeda9492ec8c54621a00ddf76be6bb
#. default-sha256: 140b712797ff73132121554b6a421d6a75e213545b56d7718571f86ddf8f306e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_80E6097D_BFF6_4A01_8208_FD02904C8D07"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He might find it relaxing when he needs a reprieve from his work..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ele pode achar relaxante quando precisar de um descanso de seu trabalho..."

#: scenario3:scenario3_01AF9E8B_AB0B_4FA1_8698_083235499A79
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 91ad7e2b9ef8fdbe089eeb6def305c0e0e389cf0abcc031f2ecfc8c70387b1d4
#. default-sha256: bb3f6ba2f1fcf2bcf9d716027d5edf442cfb24f7d43acb308abe8685e99a4822
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_01AF9E8B_AB0B_4FA1_8698_083235499A79"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Oh, is that so?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫You are very kindhearted."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Ah, é mesmo?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Você é muito bondosa."

#: scenario3:scenario3_9531573C_F950_4C64_B994_3D6AAD50D1D4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a15273f3abb371969f37020dcca7b823bbb9491dc395df43803c6be0ed136cab
#. default-sha256: 4e111a70b84d7d7c2b5960fe55edee615049de8c4a2bb8a67095c235f34959f1
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9531573C_F950_4C64_B994_3D6AAD50D1D4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Speaking of white roses, the rose he meant to give you was the same shade of white."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Falando em rosas brancas, a rosa que ele queria te dar era do mesmo tom de branco."

#: scenario3:scenario3_6003C6F8_58E3_45C3_AA57_561D9C9D7424
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 76adc821b0b7a2fc53702038930579552fb73e4c513e872558ea1f53a6d03f8f
#. default-sha256: a9bdbfe3ec34bb3df484f203840e95f99b04d189076419b5546566470ccbbc96
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_6003C6F8_58E3_45C3_AA57_561D9C9D7424"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Oh? “He”?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Ah? \"Ele\"?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_7C64D774_C5B1_447B_AAFF_C2DF2C458337
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a6551dbd312d85db675d20c37281e061918f4e89a77df743bedb283138251864
#. default-sha256: f1f2876e23cf8ac9211d726ffac0aef1cc082487c059ebdc60f869186ee251e3
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_7C64D774_C5B1_447B_AAFF_C2DF2C458337"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫But when you touched it, it turned a deep shade of red."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Mas quando você a tocou, transformou-se em um profundo tom de vermelho."

#: scenario3:scenario3_586CF5EF_B1B9_43E5_87C7_70D5D1557952
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 65a4baaa7062aeded1786d5677177a5e18dc67e44c0d0a493b83c0d98119b3f7
#. default-sha256: 852e02ba657507bb1b7cca89cbf9211aff1d11be2181e469c20eab06dda44dd8
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_586CF5EF_B1B9_43E5_87C7_70D5D1557952"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫There was but a single white rose in the garden,⟪k:25⟫"
"so he was unable to give it to you as he had wished.⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫In its place, he had a decorative "
"rose fashioned for you."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫Havia apenas uma única rosa branca no jardim,⟪k:25⟫"
"então ele não pôde dar a você como ele desejava.⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫No lugar dela, ele providenciou para "
"que fosse feita uma rosa decorativa para você."

#: scenario3:scenario3_7D4A9BCE_6B49_490E_A0EA_E8F4D28BE8C1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 05a3ccf9ee78bca5a96eeab9733bfb4f985e20ca0d47951da2f49dbbd5828ee3
#. default-sha256: 6a1592450263439e81227251494d1007da4e9d8c2908b43dc8aec67def743862
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_7D4A9BCE_6B49_490E_A0EA_E8F4D28BE8C1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫U-⟪k:3⟫Um, what exactly are you referring to?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫H-⟪k:3⟫Hum, a que exatamente você está se referindo?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_19D477A7_AE3D_49E4_AFC6_CA8316B0C73F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 907494e4c43eaaa20d6e1a7be0c9de237d095ebaf324fbd18439e314279a2d27
#. default-sha256: 9f4ebdb1c2ad754036097423e78f066d8e23bd4344bae177bd2fbbdb451ec551
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_19D477A7_AE3D_49E4_AFC6_CA8316B0C73F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Oh dear. Do you not remember?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Oh céus. Você não se lembra?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_5B478897_8F03_49D5_AF85_494B5627FA4B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bfeb6e861ef5ef16d4e2eb6a5322e7d1dbf38a658fa0b2815cb6324fdaa8f3e3
